<title>FRANCE: Two wheat ships expected in Rouen very shortly.</title>
<headline>Two wheat ships expected in Rouen very shortly.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1996-10-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Two ships were expected in Rouen very shortly to load a combined 38,000 tonnes of wheat, port officials said on Tuesday. The destination was not specified.</p>
<p>One ship was also expected very shortly to load 35,000 tonnes of barley, they said.</p>
<p>In Rouen four ships were currently loading a total of 64,000 tonnes of wheat destined for west Africa, Algeria, Italy and Morocco.</p>
<p>--Paris newsroom +33 1 4221 5432</p>
